\title{Hatem Zaag：Soliton Resolution at Blow-Up for the Subconformal Nonlinear Wave Equation}
\date{2026-10-21}
\taxon{Reference}
\author{author}

\p{Hatem Zaag，\em{Soliton Resolution at Blow-Up for the Subconformal Nonlinear Wave Equation}，载 \em{Proceedings of the International Congress of Mathematicians 2026}，第5卷，第10节，368–387页。SIAM，2026年7月13日在线出版。[出版社全文与 DOI](https://epubs.siam.org/doi/10.1137/25M1806892)。}

\p{固定预印本版本为 [arXiv:2609.17245v1](https://arxiv.org/abs/2609.17245v1)，2026年9月15日，[20页全文](https://arxiv.org/pdf/2609.17245v1)。专题中的报告定理与公式编号依此版本。官方报告主列为分析第8节，跨列偏微分方程第10节及数学物理第11节；出版卷节与报告主列分别保留。}

\p{正式版版权为 © 2026 International Mathematical Union，由 SIAM 按 [CC BY 4.0](https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/4.0/) 出版。[中文专题](4900)据原报告改写和重新组织，并加入独立推导；未复制原图。以下原始论文各保留其自身的版权条款。}

\p{Frank Merle、Hatem Zaag，\em{Existence and universality of the blow-up profile for the semilinear wave equation in one space dimension}，J. Funct. Anal. 253 (2007)，43–121页，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1016/j.jfa.2007.03.007)，[作者全文](https://www.math.univ-paris13.fr/~zaag/publications/MZjfa07.pdf)。命题1给出定常分类，定理3及推论4给出单孤子捕获与收敛。}

\p{Frank Merle、Hatem Zaag，\em{Existence and classification of characteristic points at blow-up for a semilinear wave equation in one space dimension}，Amer. J. Math. 134 (2012)，581–648页，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1353/ajm.2012.0021)。所用 [arXiv:0811.4068v1](https://arxiv.org/abs/0811.4068v1) 的题名为 \em{Existence and characterization of characteristic points for a semilinear wave equation in one space dimension}，其命题6是多孤子陈述。}

\p{Raphaël Côte、Hatem Zaag，\em{Construction of a multisoliton blowup solution to the semilinear wave equation in one space dimension}，Comm. Pure Appl. Math. 66 (2013)，1541–1581页，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1002/cpa.21452)，固定全文 [arXiv:1110.2512v1](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1110.2512v1)。定理1与定理3分别精化特征点渐近并实现预设孤子数。}

\p{Frank Merle、Hatem Zaag，\em{On the stability of the notion of non-characteristic point and blow-up profile for semilinear wave equations}，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1007/s00220-014-2132-8)，固定全文 [arXiv:1309.7760v1](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1309.7760v1)。定理1–2处理高维单孤子收敛区。}

\p{Frank Merle、Hatem Zaag，\em{Blowup solutions to the semilinear wave equation with a stylized pyramid as a blowup surface}，Comm. Pure Appl. Math. 71 (2018)，1850–1937页，[DOI](https://doi.org/10.1002/cpa.21756)，固定全文 [arXiv:1610.05637v1](https://arxiv.org/pdf/1610.05637v1)。定理1处理二维四孤子与金字塔曲面。}
